---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Blog
pageDescription: Weekly notes on staying calm, not reacting, and protecting your peace.
---
<section class="section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:800px">
  <h2 style="color:var(--ink)">The Blog</h2>
  <p class="sub" style="color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:60ch">Short, practical notes on staying steady, one small idea at a time. A new post every week.</p>
  <div class="rule"><span></span></div>
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="post-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
      <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.pageDescription }}</p>
    </a>
    {% else %}
    <p>The first posts are on their way. Check back soon.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div></section>
